<title>POLAND: KUTNO JUNE NET TURNS TO PLN 1.8 MLN LOSS.</title>
<headline>KUTNO JUNE NET TURNS TO PLN 1.8 MLN LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.76 vs   2.08 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.50 vs   3.24</p>
